			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1332277">
									

<p>Based on the current draft, since I missed the earlier ones - I <em>seriously</em> dislike those effects. They're too goddamn obvious. Basically this SCP is a more specific form of Thing What Makes You Go Crazy For No Reason, and it does so in a way I find completely uninteresting. The rest of the article I like. But to me, the lynchpin of the whole thing is that list of effects, and I am downvoting accordingly.</p>
<p>(I do like the use of alternate terms like Philargyria for Avarice, as a side note.)</p>

